00:41:21.280 --> 00:41:22.520
Like, you can't take him away.

00:41:22.720 --> 00:41:23.560
Yeah. I also think...

00:41:23.560 --> 00:41:25.280
I mean, it's that whole thing where...

00:41:25.280 --> 00:41:29.200
I mean, correct me if I'm wrong, but I'm pretty sure Disney was setting out to make a mascot as well.

00:41:29.200 --> 00:41:32.320
So, maybe partially Steamboat Willie, but then all the things that came afterwards...

00:41:32.860 --> 00:41:33.900
Sure. Like, I don't remember.

00:41:34.140 --> 00:41:37.760
I don't know for sure, but was Mickey Mouse designed as, like, a random character?

00:41:37.800 --> 00:41:39.240
And then they were like, oh, he's so popular.

00:41:39.320 --> 00:41:40.280
Let's put him in other things.

00:41:40.320 --> 00:41:41.340
Or was it like, he's our mascot.

00:41:41.340 --> 00:41:48.820
Let's put him in it. I think it was Steamboat Willie was such a big success because it also happened to, like, sync music to the cartoon.

00:41:48.820 --> 00:41:51.300
And that was, like, a big deal, I guess, at the time.

00:41:51.420 --> 00:41:54.220
But also, it's runtime and things, too.

00:41:54.400 --> 00:42:01.360
Went for it because Mickey Mouse was in two cartoons before Steamboat Willie that, like, Walt Disney doesn't want you to know.

00:42:01.620 --> 00:42:04.640
Yeah. Plane Crazy and another one.

00:42:05.300 --> 00:42:07.360
Jiminy's Journal and Kingdom Hearts didn't tell me that.

00:42:07.460 --> 00:42:09.660
In Plane Crazy, he smokes a cigarette.

00:42:10.140 --> 00:42:11.820
Oh, man. So, Mickey Mouse. And he looks a little different.

00:42:12.000 --> 00:42:13.540
He looks a little more like a mouse.

00:42:14.300 --> 00:42:17.860
So, I definitely think that, you know, the design is important.

00:42:18.040 --> 00:42:19.200
Absolutely. You know?

00:42:19.320 --> 00:42:23.420
And I'm sure that, like, a ton of research goes in as mascots continue.

00:42:23.780 --> 00:42:28.560
Yeah. Like, Sonic the Hedgehog was probably much more thought of in terms of design and look.

00:42:28.800 --> 00:42:30.480
It was much more marketing focused.

00:42:30.480 --> 00:42:32.540
Right. Than, say, like, Mario was even.

00:42:32.720 --> 00:42:35.220
You know? Like, Mario was probably more like, look at this.

00:42:35.280 --> 00:42:38.040
We came up with this funny idea of, like, an Italian plumber.

00:42:38.180 --> 00:42:40.080
How do we make this guy look as cool as possible?

00:42:40.080 --> 00:42:41.760
Right. And so, it's amazing that it paid off.

00:42:41.760 --> 00:42:52.560
But you could say that, you know, a good game does matter even more because, you know, Crash Bandicoot had a great, like, start out the gate with those first three games.

00:42:52.860 --> 00:42:56.360
And it's not like his mascot design is anything, like, amazing.

00:42:56.520 --> 00:42:59.060
Right. But you think of him now and, like, you know, there's, like, a...

00:42:59.060 --> 00:43:01.840
But that's where I think that there are maybe almost, like, two roads, too.

00:43:01.960 --> 00:43:07.080
I mean, granted, like you said, Crash Bandicoot just happened to be an amazing game that, like, got really popular.

00:43:07.980 --> 00:43:13.240
But I think, like, there's a simple, overly relatable mascot, like, design-wise.

00:43:13.300 --> 00:43:14.720
And then there's a Bandicoot.

00:43:14.800 --> 00:43:16.900
Who had heard of a Bandicoot before Crash Bandicoot?

00:43:16.900 --> 00:43:24.380
I think that part of it is there's, like, some intrigue, which I think they maybe missed the mark here where it's, like, people have heard of Russian X Circus fire-breathing people.

00:43:24.480 --> 00:43:31.000
It's definitely a spectrum, though, because you've got the home runs like Super Mario, Mickey, and...

00:43:31.000 --> 00:43:31.840
Minecraft Steve.

00:43:32.020 --> 00:43:41.960
And Sonic. But then you have, in the middle, I think that Crash Bandicoot is not a success story in terms of a mascot.

00:43:41.960 --> 00:43:48.380
It was forced for a while, but until, like, the remakes, nobody was really itching for a new Crash Bandicoot game.

00:43:48.380 --> 00:43:52.560
