00:43:56.580 --> 00:43:57.380
In its...

00:43:57.380 --> 00:44:07.000
I think, you know, in the time of the 90s Crash Bandicoot games, Crash was on track to be the Sony mascot.

00:44:07.100 --> 00:44:08.020
They kind of, like, let go of it.

00:44:08.020 --> 00:44:09.960
Yeah, we're derailing this conversation.

00:44:10.480 --> 00:44:16.380
Yeah, yeah, yeah. But I will say that, like, I actually think it was a very smart decision for Sony to stay out of the mascot race.

00:44:16.540 --> 00:44:17.780
Because it's not their thing. Right.

00:44:17.920 --> 00:44:20.320
